 RB Hollywood Smothers ruled out vs. Ole Miss","description":"Texas will be without top tailback Hollywood Smothers for Saturday's showdown vs. No. 7 Ole Miss as the No. 19 Longhorns try to avoid a third straight loss.","published":"2026-10-24T18:33:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50265566/texas-rb-hollywood-smothers-ruled-vs-ole-miss","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Former Auburn receiver Cam Coleman transfers to Texas","description":"Cam Coleman, the No. 2 player in ESPN's transfer portal rankings who had 708 receiving yards and five TDs for Auburn last season, is transferring to Texas.","published":"2026-01-12T20:39:27.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47581504/former-auburn-receiver-cam-coleman-commits-texas","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman race for Week 12: Wake Forest's Gio Lopez makes late push","description":"Much like his team, the Demon Deacons' QB has slipped under the radar much of the season -- but no more.","published":"2026-11-24T11:31:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50573849/heisman-race-wake-forest-gio-lopez","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Tiering the CFP favorites: Who's actually built to win on top of the odds board","description":"CFP futures got murkier after Saturday's results. But which teams can actually go far in the tournament?","published":"2026-11-24T12:03:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50573806/2026-college-football-playoff-cfp-futures-odds-picks","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the College Football Playoff bubble before committee's fourth ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-24T11:29:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What qualities make the perfect coach? We're borrowing from the best","description":"If we can build a coach in a lab, we can start with these qualities and skills.","published":"2026-11-24T11:23:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50476785/building-perfect-coach","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"SEC to consider termination of LSU's membership at Dec. 3 meeting","description":"For the second time this year, the SEC is threatening to hold a vote of its chancellors and presidents on whether to kick LSU out of the league, according to a filing in federal court in Alabama on Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T12:52:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/50577602/sec-consider-termination-lsu-membership","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia defensive coordinator Glenn Schumann agrees to coach Florida State","description":"Georgia's Glenn Schumann, one of the country's top defensive coordinators and part of a staff that has the Bulldogs at No. 1 in the CFP rankings, agreed to a five-year deal to become the next coach at Florida State, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T02:51:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577665/uga-defensive-coordinator-schumann-coach-florida-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Aiden Flora, nation's leading rusher, re-signs with Iowa State for next season","description":"Iowa State running back Aiden Flora, who leads the nation in rushing, announced Monday that he has re-signed with the Cyclones for next season.","published":"2026-11-23T23:57:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577520/aiden-flora-nation-leading-rusher-re-signs-iowa-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"David Wilson","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4871053/hollywood-smothers","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hollywood_Smothers"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Hollywood Smothers","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hollywood_Smothers","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:11Z","intro":"Daylan \"Hollywood\" Smothers (born February 3, 2005) is an American college football running back for the Texas Longhorns. He previously played for the Oklahoma Sooners and NC State Wolfpack.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Smothers attended Julius L. Chambers High School in Charlotte, North Carolina, for three years before transferring to West Charlotte High School in Charlotte for his senior year. He rushed for 1,206 yards and 12 touchdowns was named North Carolina Mr. Football his sophomore year and had 1,581 yards and 28 touchdowns his junior year. Smothers was suspended and was unable to play his senior year due to an eligibility issue. He committed to the University of Oklahoma to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"OKLAHOMA\nSmothers played four games his true freshman year at Oklahoma in 2023, recording 11 rushes for 42 yards and maintaining his eligibility. After the season, he entered the transfer portal and transferred to NC State University.\n\nNC STATE\nHe entered his first year at NC State as a backup before starting the final six games of the season. For the 2025 season, he had 571 yards on 89 carries and six touchdowns. In the 2025 season, Smothers recorded 939 rushing yards, 189 receiving yards, six rushing touchdowns, and two receiving touchdowns. He was named to the All-ACC first team. At the end of the season, Smothers entered the transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS\nSmothers initially committed to Alabama but later flipped his commitment to Texas on January 11, 2026. In Week 2 of the 2026 season against Ohio State, Smothers scored his first touchdown as a Longhorn, recording 74 running yards for two touchdowns. In Week 7 against Florida, he sustained a shoulder injury leading him to miss the next game. In the Week 9 game against Mississippi State, Smothers suffered a torn MCL, leading him to miss the remainder of the season."}]}}